	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'I was shocked, though...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'So was I, Prince Patton.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, no need to call me a'
	R
	'prince anymore. I’m just the'
	R
	'leader of a rebel army now.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'No... To me, you’ll always be'
	R
	'the prince.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s an honor just to be'
	R
	'sitting in your presence like'
	R
	'this...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Stop it, seriously...'
	R
	'You’re embarrassing me.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Hahaha...'
	R
	'You’ve changed, Prince Patton.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'...Have I?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes. You’re much more of a man'
	R
	'than you used to be. I’m sure'
	R
	'you worked hard...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Nah... That’s not true.'
	R
	'...Why did you join the Leazas'
	R
	'Army anyway, General Lelyukov?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Because...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bdf:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t tell him... It would put'
	R
	'needless worry on the Prince for'
	R
	'him to know about Amiran...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'General Lelyukov?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'I was very charmed by the King'
	R
	'of Leazas.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'...Really?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Prince...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Helman is in your hands...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'My and Thoma’s generation is'
	R
	'over. Now it’s you youngsters'
	R
	'and your youth’s generation.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Give happiness to our'
	R
	'suffering people...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'I know... I fully intend to do'
	R
	'everything I can.'
	R
	'Also, General Lelyukov.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Stop being so depressing.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Be someone who’s always around'
	R
	'to urge slow guys like us into'
	R
	'action.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'...Your respect is wasted on'
	R
	'me, Prince...'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Hahaha.'
	R
	'Alright, let’s go outside and'
	R
	'train together.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Prince.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b8b:
	ZH 1:
	'Patton and Lelyukov chatted as'
	R
	'they left the room.'
