		'about her hair color?'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'............'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'Huh?'
		R
		'That bothers you so much it’s'
		R
		'stopping you from sleeping?'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Yeah, it is. That’s what happens'
		R
		'when I’m wondering about'
		R
		'something.'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'So tell me about it right now.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'Yeah... About her hair...'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'...I’ve never asked about it...'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'You’ve asked a lot about Hanty,'
		R
		'King of Leazas.'
		R
		'Are you interested in her?'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'I’m interested in all cute'
		R
		'girls.'
