		'She’s your woman, isn’t she?'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'...What if I said she was?'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Gahahahahahahaha.'
		R
		'Then I’d have to steal her'
		R
		'from you, of course.'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'I’ll ask you peacefully now.'
		R
		'Give her to me.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'It should be obvious enough from'
		R
		'how I am that I can’t get by'
		R
		'without her. So...'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Wait... You’re supposed to be an'
		R
		'emperor. Just hire 10, maybe 100'
		R
		'maids and you’re good.'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'So give her to me.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'No, maids wouldn’t work... I,'
		R
		'uh... I need someone I can train'
