		ZH 1:
		'Other things...'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'Yeah.'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'Also, she’s a tomboy. I think a'
		R
		'more graceful girl would be a'
		R
		'better fit for you. Yeah.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Whatever, I get it. She’s yours,'
		R
