		'Don’t panic so much about it.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'No, she’s just...'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Don’t worry about it.'
		R
		'I feel too bad to take her'
		R
		'from you now...'
