	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Helman'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'  The Border - Kalar Forest'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Hundreds of soldiers were'
	R
	'gathered here in secret.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'It was a force gathered for'
	R
	'Patton, the exiled Prince of'
	R
	'Helman.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'They were gathered to rise to'
	R
	'action.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	!VAR0516 : 423!
	\L_06ba7:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Thanks again for believing in'
	R
	'me enough to renounce our'
	R
	'country and fight with me.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b8b:
	ZH 1:
	'Patton stood before the'
	R
	'gathered revolutionaries and'
	R
	'spoke.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	!VAR0516 : 425!
	\L_06c17:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s not really like they'
	R
	'gathered for you or anything.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06c25:
	!VAR0516 : 424!
	\L_06c17:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'No joking around, Hugh.'
	R
	'This is a big, important'
	R
	'moment for Patton.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'You two, shut up and listen!!'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b8b:
	ZH 1:
	'Wahahahaha...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'The core of the gathering,'
	R
	'Patton, Thoma’s son Hubert,'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'and Patton’s nanny/sister/ lover'
	R
	'kalar Hanty were there.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Everyone laughed at their'
	R
	'exchange.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'They all believed these were'
	R
	'people who could be trusted with'
	R
	'the nation.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Unshakeable trust was an'
	R
	'invisible bond that united the'
	R
	'soldiers.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Ahem...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'The time has come. We never'
	R
	'expected this’d happen, but'
	R
	'Leazas attacked Helman.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'We’ll never have a better'
	R
	'chance.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'But before we rise to action,'
	R
	'I’ll say this one more time!'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'I haven’t thought at all about'
	R
	'making a good nation.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'I just want revenge on those'
	R
	'that betrayed me, and...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'In order to realize the dream'
	R
	'of my mother who was murdered,'
	R
	'I’ll return to Helman!'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06c25:
	!VAR0516 : 425!
	\L_06c17:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'After all this time...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t be a jerk and say you'
	R
	'won’t come with us.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06c25:
	!VAR0516 : 426!
	\L_06c17:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Everyone, I think everything'
	R
	'will become easier when Patton'
	R
	'becomes our ruler.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'You should believe in him and'
	R
	'push on as you desire.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b8b:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s right!!'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'No mercy for Stessel!'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s do our best, everyone!'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'...Alright...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Then let’s do this!'
	R
	'No regrets, even if we die!!'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b8b:
	ZH 1:
	'Oooooooooooh!!'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Everyone shouted and flushed'
	R
	'with energy.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'They aren’t a big army that'
	R
	'has the money to do everything'
	R
	'imaginable, but...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Infused with hope and spirit,'
	R
	'the revolutionary army looked'
	R
	'invincible...'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'That was the kind of air they'
	R
	'gave off.'
