	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you saying you’ll work'
	R
	'under us?'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah. You can have the right to'
	R
	'command us. We’ll move at your'
	R
	'orders.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Given one condition.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'After Sheila is defeated, I'
	R
	'want you to leave Helman to me.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course, I’m planning on'
	R
	'making it a friendly ally to'
	R
	'Leazas.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b6f:
	ZH 1:
	'Hoh... This is going just how'
	R
	'Maris said it would.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b53:
	ZH 1:
	'Sure. We’ll take out our mutual'
	R
	'enemy in the current dynasty.'
