	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06b8b:
	ZH 1:
	'They would essentially be'
	R
	'treated as a subordinate nation'
	R
	'to Leazas.'
	\L_06c78:
	ZH 1:
	'Naturally, Patton was a bit'
	R
	'worried.'
	\L_06c78:
	\L_06c6b:
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'...Okay.'
	R
	'That’s fine.'
