		'any longer.'
		\L_06c78:
		ZH 1:
		'Our enemy is someone else.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Suppose so. It’s much more'
		R
		'reassuring having you as a'
		R
		'friend than as a foe.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06bc3:
		ZH 1:
		'Heh... Don’t think back on'
		R
		'when we were young.'
		\L_06c78:
		\L_06c6b:
		\L_06b53:
		ZH 1:
		'Come now.'
